	<div class="col-md-8 order-first">
		<p>If you are looking for an air compressor for the shop, barn or garage, this is the place to look. Although our air compressors range from 1/2HP to 475HP, generally shop air compressors will vary between 3HP stationary compressors to 7.5HP stationary. Most shops will use a reciprocating air compressor, rather than a rotary screw or variable speed compressor, as they are less expensive most shops do not need constant production of compressed air.</p>
		<p>Ingersoll Rand and Chicago Pneumatic are the leaders in the air compressor industry when it comes to electric and gas powered air compressors, we also carry Campbell Hausfeld, Maxus, Rol-Air and Jenny as well.</p>
